<view class="page"><view class="hero"><text>☀️ 今天的照护节奏</text><b>把小事，变成安心</b><small>提醒是交接辅助，请仍以宝宝实际状态为准</small></view><view class="preset-wrap"><text>常用提醒</text><view class="presets"><view wx:for="{{presets}}" wx:key="title" class="preset" data-item="{{item}}" bindtap="preset"><text>{{item.icon}}</text><b>{{item.title}}</b><small>{{item.clock}}</small></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{list.length}}" class="list"><view wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="id" class="item {{item.done?'done':''}}" data-item="{{item}}" bindtap="toggle" bindlongpress="remove"><text class="time">{{item.timeText}}</text><view class="check">{{item.done?'✓':''}}</view><text class="title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="more">›</text></view></view><view wx:else class="empty">今天还没有待办<br/><text>从一杯奶、一次补剂开始</text></view><view class="add" bindtap="open">＋</view><view wx:if="{{show}}" class="mask" bindtap="close"><view class="sheet" catchtap=""><b>新增照护提醒</b><input value="{{title}}" placeholder="例如：喂奶 180ml" bindinput="input"/><picker mode="time" value="{{clock}}" bindchange="time"><view class="clock">🕘 {{clock}}</view></picker><button bindtap="save">保存提醒</button></view></view></view>
